      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What they saw at a few thousand req/s per region",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What they saw at a few thousand req/s per region",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "01-local-cache:ca1-5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 407.9689025878906,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1316037296,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1015247024,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792704146411,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- an entire AZ getting 5xx for ~1 s, then\n  another AZ a few minutes later\n- some reads taking 10+ ms: the p99 target missed\n- unclear if DynamoDB, connection setup or DNS\n- every failure was within DynamoDB's SLA",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- an entire AZ getting 5xx for ~1 s, then\n  another AZ a few minutes later\n- some reads taking 10+ ms: the p99 target missed\n- unclear if DynamoDB, connection setup or DNS\n- every failure was within DynamoDB's SLA",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
